  "source": "[\\is.greatest{g}:in{X}:under{R}]\nStates:\nwhen:\n. X is \\set\n. R is \\partial.order:on{X}\n. g \"in\" X\nthat:\n. forAll: x \"in\" X\n  then: R(x, g)\nDocumented:\n. called: \"$g?$ is the greatest element of $X?$ under $R?$\"\n. description: \"The greatest element (maximum) exceeds or equals every element\n                of $X$. If a greatest element exists, it is unique and is the\n                unique maximal element.\"\nId: \"8c3b1160-03ac-4f70-856f-8dbdff0cba12\"",
